 "toplevel": "Stored-property initializers: readiness = StrapReadiness.initial, feedStatus = .waitingForStrap, downloadLedger = StrapDownloadLedger() (its own persistence lives in StrapRecording.swift), _lastSignificantLogTime starts at construction time, sdkQueue is a serial userInitiated queue. typealiases DiscoveredDevice/KnownDevice/FetchProgress point at Strap* types. `api`, `standardHeartRate`, `strapAPI`, `searchTask` exist only under canImport(PolarBleSdk); radioForTesting only under DEBUG. The header comment (:10-24) documents the forced Polar SDK 8.x upgrade.",
